From c97b34f6ad25087a1c5dbb7a821784208bc4c0fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:59:42 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: a champion and a scout visit the lobby as cups are
 cleared

Two more placed actors (ACTOR_CHAMPION, ACTOR_SCOUT, after the trophies, before the party
rows) stand beside the door: the scout (sprite 0x87) once the third cup is cleared, the
champion (0x71) after the seventh and last main cup. Their placement conditions are the
trophy flags of those cups. Talking opens a message directly through MSGNO triggers (no
handler): MsgArenaChampion (congratulations, try the side cups) and MsgArenaScout (side cups
come after the main line). The messages sit above the generated cups block in en.po;
gen-cups.py was re-run, so the generated ids moved by two.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
